OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be mostly cloudy with showers
OL,7,Fspreading eastwards, some of these may
OL,8,Fbe heavy. Showers continuing
OL,9,Fovernight. Strong southwesterly winds,
OL,10,Fespecially in the north and over
OL,11,FWestern Isles.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA mostly cloudy morning with
OL,14,Fsome showers. Cloudy in the afternoon
OL,15,Fwith a heavier band of rain spreading
OL,16,Fsoutheastwards across the west, drier
OL,17,Fsouth and east. Strong winds easing
OL,18,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
